			"type": "text",
			"text": "## CPTSD\n\nCondition hub: the ICD-11 complex PTSD construct, borrowed mechanisms with their limits, assessment, and the treatment sequencing debate.\n\n[[CPTSD Map|Open the domain map]] - snapshot of 2026-09-25; the map's *In this folder* section is the live view.",
