		},
		{
			"id": "t1_1",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Memory and trauma]]**\n*framework* - 4 sources\n\nWhat is established about memory for traumatic events, and why both popular exaggeration and dismissal are wrong.",
			"x": 450,
