			"height": 194,
			"color": "#FF6B5B"
		},
		{
			"id": "t1_2",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[PTSD biology and CPTSD evidence limits]]**\n*framework* - 10 sources\n\nWhat PTSD biology covers, why it does not transfer to complex PTSD, and the status of the dissociative subtype as the best-supported subdivision.",
			"x": 450,
			"y": 1016,
			"width": 360,
