			"color": "#FF6B5B"
		},
		{
			"id": "t1_3",
			"type": "text",
			"text": "**[[Trauma and stress responses]]**\n*process* - 6 sources\n\nAppraisal, acute versus chronic stress physiology, the immune route, and the step from traumatic exposure to a symptom-based diagnosis.",
